---
title: Fluffy French Toast
source: https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/16895/fluffy-french-toast/
servings: 6
prep_time: 10 minutes
cook_time: 20 minutes
total_time: 30 minutes
tags:
  - breakfast
  - favorite
---

Measure @all-purpose flour{0.25%cup} into a #large mixing bowl{}. Slowly whisk in @milk{1%cup} until smooth and free of lumps.

Whisk in @large eggs{3}, @granulated sugar{1%Tbsp}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{0.5%tsp}, and @salt{1%pinch} until well combined and slightly frothy.

Heat a lightly oiled or buttered #skillet{} or #griddle{} over medium heat.

Dip @thick bread slices{12} into the milk and egg mixture, turning to ensure both sides are thoroughly saturated.

Working in batches, place the soaked bread slices onto the preheated skillet or griddle. Cook for 3 to ~{4%minutes} on each side until golden brown and cooked through. Serve warm with butter and maple syrup.
